{"slug":"/members-gallery-sophie-schwartz","title":"PENUMBRA Members Gallery | SOPHIE SCHWARTZ","kicker":"Penumbra Members Gallery","section":"","hero":{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1596658531990-X1V3L13WY5HFS34V8TFK/Penumbra_04.jpg","w":2500,"h":1986,"fx":0.5,"fy":0.5,"alt":""},"description":"<p><strong>SOPHIE SCHWARTZ</strong></p><p>© Sophie Schwartz</p>","seoTitle":"","seoDescription":" A ritual at the core of my artistic practice is building portraits in collaboration with the people I hold close. I am interested in the traces people leave on one another through","nodes":[{"t":"hr"},{"t":"row","cols":[{"span":6,"nodes":[{"t":"html","html":"<p>A ritual at the core of my artistic practice is building portraits in collaboration with the people I hold close. I am interested in the traces people leave on one another through connection, collaboration, and intimacy; and how that can be rendered in a photograph. Each image is constructed slowly and together, as I work with a 4x5 view camera to build a third space between me and those photographed. </p>"}]},{"span":6,"nodes":[{"t":"quote","html":"[…] I am interested in the traces people leave on one another through connection, collaboration, and intimacy; and how that can be rendered in a photograph  […]","source":"Sophie Schwartz"}]}]},{"t":"hr"},{"t":"gallery","layout":"grid","per":5,"images":[{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1596658842080-3WT6XXARE7JNCI58VWTA/Penumbra_11.jpg","w":1179,"h":1500,"fx":0.5,"fy":0.5,"alt":""},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1596658842247-CGKWTJYWZLQ06ZB72I5Y/Penumbra_05.jpg","w":2500,"h":3173,"fx":0.5,"fy":0.5,"alt":""},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1596658843306-L3ACZG7XLAP0GR284TRI/Penumbra_04.jpg","w":2500,"h":1986,"fx":0.5,"fy":0.5,"alt":""},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1596658843944-BAJSF5FXHF2NKSMDP2HX/Penumbra_10.jpg","w":2500,"h":1980,"fx":0.5,"fy":0.5,"alt":""},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1596658845466-ZVS1QHO5PIINH9AGUJ3P/Penumbra_06.jpg","w":2500,"h":3191,"fx":0.5,"fy":0.5,"alt":""},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1596658845350-ESSD3XYXMKQW3CWCUJK3/Penumbra_12.jpg","w":2500,"h":3131,"fx":0.5,"fy":0.5,"alt":""},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1596658847246-1568OF9DF28QW1MCQ6FG/Penumbra_13.jpg","w":2500,"h":3131,"fx":0.5,"fy":0.5,"alt":""},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1596658847329-FOFUOS935KO7D029M81Y/Penumbra_07.jpg","w":2500,"h":3158,"fx":0.5,"fy":0.5,"alt":""},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1596658848955-9GYXQTA9JV77N603QY4Z/Penumbra_03.jpg","w":2500,"h":3199,"fx":0.5,"fy":0.5,"alt":""},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1596658849543-HLJ364RBZKM5EX7L76U5/Penumbra_02.jpg","w":1500,"h":1192,"fx":0.5,"fy":0.5,"alt":""},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1596658850070-26P8RTQRN5OVO723D95V/Penumbra_14.jpg","w":1183,"h":1500,"fx":0.5,"fy":0.5,"alt":""},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1596658850363-5II69GZ6M5G5SBIUKKKF/Penumbra_01.jpg","w":845,"h":1080,"fx":0.5,"fy":0.5,"alt":""},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1596658851457-J9KLP8B1KKURAAMGRLKN/Penumbra_15.jpg","w":1189,"h":1500,"fx":0.5,"fy":0.5,"alt":""},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1596658851854-QFYEQ2INMWJIL6Y695RI/Penumbra_09.jpg","w":2500,"h":1956,"fx":0.5,"fy":0.5,"alt":""},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1596658852545-RJBDZ8OP81RSSMAYN4A1/Penumbra_08.jpg","w":2500,"h":3241,"fx":0.5,"fy":0.5,"alt":""}]},{"t":"hr"},{"t":"html","html":"<p><strong>Sophie Schwartz </strong>is a Cleveland born artist living in New York City. She is a 2017 graduate of the Modern Culture + Media program at Brown University. Her work bridges traditional technique with contemporary content, working primarily with a large format view camera. She has been exhibited nationally, with her most recent solo exhibition in Cleveland, Ohio. She has been a teaching assistant at Brown University, AS220 Industries, and Maine Media Workshops + College. She was invited to be an artist in residence for the Cleveland Foundation Creative Fusion residency program in 2018 – 2019.</p>"},{"t":"hr"},{"t":"html","html":"<p>← <a href=\"/members-gallery-odette-england\">previous</a></p>"},{"t":"html","html":"<p><a href=\"/members-gallery-johnna-arnold\">next</a> →</p>"}],"updated":1600875420160}